  "_about": "a male lion SCULPTED on the cat frame (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/lion.py from the tiger's shapes): taller on the leg and shorter in the body than the tiger, a long square muzzle and broad nose; the mane a collar of locks (the coat's quills) from behind the ears over neck, shoulders and chest, golden round the face and dark behind; plain tawny, paler beneath; a long thin tail with a black tuft || THE FACE AND FEET (2026-11-06): one cat's face for both -- the L3 shapes: a rounded cranium and a broad forehead dropping steeply to a short bridge (L3cran, L3brow, L3bridge), broad cheeks, a boxy muzzle with puffy whisker pads creased off the cheek, a white upper lip and chin, a broad nose leather with a dark rim (paints), the lip line and philtrum and a tear line painted, white under the eyes; the eyes forward and frontal (eyeX/eyeY/eyeZ/eyeF on sculpt.eyes); round ears to the side, black-backed and pale inside. faceX: metres his muzzle sits further forward than hers. The paws compact (pawS) with four toe lobes each, about 1.25x the leg above; a carpal bump and a bent pastern at the wrist (wrist); a clear hock with the heel behind it (hock); the thigh tapering to the knee (hind). mesh.cell 1.4cm, 12000 triangles near: the face and toes need it",
